tweets.text:
Starlink keeps working when the towers go down.
@elonmusk on why the Starlink Mini matters in a disaster:

"If there's forest fires, floods, natural disasters… you lose the ground fiber and you lose the cell towers, then you still have access to the internet with the Starlink." https://t.co/zhTULnQB2m

tweets.text_zh:
当塔楼倒塌时，星链仍能继续工作。
@elonmusk 解释为什么 Starlink Mini 在灾难中很重要：

“如果发生森林火灾、洪水、自然灾害……你失去了地面光纤和手机信号塔，那么你仍然可以通过星链访问互联网。” https://t.co/zhTULnQB2m

